                <div type="edition" xml:lang="okz-Latn" rendition="class:83231 maturity:83213">
                   <p>
<lb n="1"/>sabvamastu jeyyātīỵreka 1553 qnakkhasa-
   <lb n="2"/>tva chnāṁ mamaeha khaeha jesa 3 keta thṅaiya
   <lb n="3"/>canabārassāranā jumanuma Assaṅa phoṅa
   <lb n="4"/>māna qnaka yeṅa qnaka saṁmteca braḥ mahā-
   <lb n="5"/>maṅgalapubita nu qnaka samteca braḥ pavara-
   <lb n="6"/>saththāha nu qnaka samteca mokagalāna I-
   <lb n="7"/>s samteca therānuthera bhikkhasusaṅa phoṅa
   <lb n="8"/>dăṅa hlāỵ tapada tā yassarāja Oỵ jī-<!-- kuch: Oy the ya was written as subscript. -->
   <lb n="9"/>ya jaiỵ neḥ rūca jā braiya Isa ñāttika<!-- kuch: jaiỵ the ya was written as subscript.  -->
   <lb n="10"/>phoṅa dăṅ prāmabila santāna neḥ thā pqeha<!-- kuch: pqeha -->
   <lb n="11"/>nnā bibāta mtātrā yoka jiỵ jaiỵ neḥ jā khñaṁma vi-<!-- kuch: jiỵ ; jaiỵ the ya was written as subscript. -->
   <lb n="12"/>ña leya ri E grahasa gi jā bicañāṇa sota A-
   <lb n="13"/>kahlūṅa l̥̄ pa˘narāja nu Akahlūṅa dhūpesavaṅsā nu qna-<!-- kuch: pa˘narāja -->
   <lb n="14"/>ka tā yassarāja nu qnaka tūṇa māsa nu tūṇa jaiỵ <!-- kuch: jaiy the ya was written as subscript. -->
   <lb n="15"/>meya kesa me nuṅa cova Ina cova canarema
   <lb n="16"/>Isa poṅa phUṇa dăṅa Aṁmpāla neḥ yoka jiỵ<!-- kuch: jiy the ya was written as subscript.   -->
   <lb n="17"/>jīỵ neḥ jā khñaṁma viña leya rănadaḥha pă-<!-- kuch: jīỵ the ya was written as subscript. -->
   <lb n="18"/>ña jheha Appadissa kti kuma pi trūva leỵ
   <lb n="19"/>Oỵ trūva qnaka daṅa Ampāla noḥ hoṅa bvu e-<!-- kuch: Oy the ya was written as subscript ; e- -->
   <lb n="20"/>nāḥ sota braḥ trăsa Ampāla khasăca ta kti ku-<!-- kuch: nāḥ  -->
<lb n="21"/>mpi prossa qnaka noḥ pāna leya hoṅa<!-- kuhc: mpi the pa was written as subscript. -->
                   </p>
</div>
